    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a helpful assistant for a finance department. A transaction could not be automatically reconciled with a booking. Your task is to draft the body of an alert email.\n\nThe email should be clear, professional, and actionable. Summarize the key details of the transaction provided below and explicitly ask the user to investigate it in the \"transactions_sample\" sheet and manually match it in the \"bookings_master\" sheet.\n\n## Transaction Details ##\nDate: {{ $('Read_Transactions').item.json.Date }}\nDescription:{{ $('Read_Transactions').item.json.Description }}\nAmount: {{ $('Read_Transactions').item.json.Amount }}\nTransaction ID: {{ $('Read_Transactions').item.json.Transaction_ID }}\nGenerate only the email body in HTML Format.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
